---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE_EMAIL } from '../config/site';

const canonicalUrl = 'https://calcumetrics.com/privacy-policy';
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Calcumetrics"
  description="How Calcumetrics handles your data, including our use of Google AdSense advertising cookies and your consent choices."
  canonical={canonicalUrl}
>
  <div class="max-w-[700px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <p class="text-xs text-text-muted mb-2">Last updated: 23 September 2026</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Effective date: 23 September 2026. This policy describes how Calcumetrics collects, uses, and shares information when you use our website at calcumetrics.com.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">1. Who we are and how to contact us</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Calcumetrics is an independent financial calculator website. For any privacy-related query or to exercise your rights, contact us at: <a href={`mailto:${SITE_EMAIL}`} class="text-accent hover:underline focus-visible:outline-accent">{SITE_EMAIL}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">2. What we collect</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-2"><strong>Calculator inputs:</strong> All calculator inputs are processed entirely in your browser. They are not transmitted to our servers, not stored, and not sent to any third party. Calculator state may be saved to your browser's URL hash (for share links) or <code>localStorage</code> (for remembered currency preference — key: <code>cm_currency</code>). This data stays on your device only.</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4"><strong>Usage data:</strong> When Google AdSense is active, Google's ad technology collects standard web data — including IP address, device identifiers, browser type, and pages visited — for the purpose of serving and measuring ads. We do not separately collect or log server-side usage data beyond what is standard in web server access logs (IP, URL, timestamp), which are retained for a short period for security purposes.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">3. Cookies and similar technologies</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      We use the following categories of cookies and storage:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-sm text-text-muted mb-4 pl-2">
      <li><strong>Strictly necessary:</strong> No essential cookies at this time (no login, no session).</li>
      <li><strong>Preferences:</strong> <code>localStorage</code> keys: <code>cm_currency</code> (stores your selected currency, e.g. INR, USD) and <code>cm_theme</code> (stores your dark/light appearance preference). No expiry; stays until you clear browser storage.</li>
      <li><strong>Advertising (Google AdSense):</strong> When active, Google AdSense sets cookies and uses device identifiers to serve personalised ads and measure ad performance. These are third-party cookies set by Google's ad technology.</li>
      <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> If analytics are added in future, this policy will be updated before they are enabled.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      To manage your preferences, use the <button type="button" id="privacy-cookie-settings-link" class="text-accent hover:underline cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-accent">Cookie settings</button> link (opens the consent dialog) or see our <a href="/cookie-policy" class="text-accent hover:underline focus-visible:outline-accent">Cookie Policy</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">4. Third-party advertising — Google AdSense</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      We plan to display ads through Google AdSense. Google and its partners use cookies and identifiers (including the DoubleClick cookie) to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites.
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-sm text-text-muted mb-4 pl-2">
      <li>For users in the EEA, UK, and Switzerland: personalised ads will only be served after you give consent through our Google-certified Consent Management Platform (CMP). Until then, you may see non-personalised ads only.</li>
      <li>To opt out of personalised ads: visit <a href="https://optout.aboutads.info/" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline">aboutads.info</a> or your <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline">Google Ad Settings</a>.</li>
      <li>Read <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-accent hover:underline">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      We load AdSense scripts asynchronously, after consent state is known. We never send calculator inputs or results to Google Analytics or any advertising system — only page-level events (such as "calculator page viewed") may be recorded.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">5. Legal bases and your rights</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      Depending on your location, you may have rights under GDPR/UK GDPR (access, correction, deletion, restriction, portability, objection, withdrawal of consent), India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act 2023, or applicable US state privacy laws (CCPA/CPRA and others). To exercise any right, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE_EMAIL}`} class="text-accent hover:underline focus-visible:outline-accent">{SITE_EMAIL}</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">6. Data retention and security</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      We do not store calculator inputs on any server. Any data held by Google AdSense or analytics providers is subject to Google's own retention policies. We implement HTTPS, HSTS, and standard security headers. No system is 100% secure; use this site at your own risk.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">7. Children</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
      This site is not directed at children under 13 (or the applicable age of digital consent in your country). We do not knowingly collect personal data from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal data, contact us and we will delete it.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">8. Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
      We update this policy when our practices change. The "Last updated" date at the top reflects the date of the last material change. Continued use of the site after a change constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>

<script>
  // Reuse the footer's cookie settings event so this link also opens the CMP
  document.getElementById('privacy-cookie-settings-link')?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('calcumetrics:open-cookie-settings'));
  });
</script>
